<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="meta">Ordinal num &middot; Last updated: August 17, 2026</p>

<p>This app <strong>does not collect any personal information</strong>. It contains no analytics tools, no advertising SDKs, and no third-party components of any kind.</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>None. We do not collect, transmit, or store any personal data, including names, email addresses, location, device identifiers, or usage data.</p>

<h2>2. Data Stored on Your Device</h2>
<p>The following is stored only on your device and is never transmitted to us or anyone else.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Best times and recent play records (time, misses, per-tap intervals, tapped cell positions)</li>
  <li>Appearance (white / black) and language settings</li>
  <li>In-app purchase status</li>
</ul>
<p>All of it is removed when you delete the app from your device.</p>

<h2>3. Game Center</h2>
<p>Leaderboards use Apple's Game Center. If you are signed in to Game Center, your Time Attack result (elapsed time) is sent to Apple's servers and listed on the leaderboard. Your Game Center display name and account information are managed by Apple; this app neither retrieves nor stores them. Apple's handling of this data is governed by the <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/">Apple Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<p>The app is fully playable without signing in to Game Center.</p>

<h2>4. In-App Purchase</h2>
<p>All payments are processed by Apple. This app only learns whether a purchase has been made. It never receives or stores payment details such as card numbers, names, or addresses.</p>

<h2>5. Sharing with Third Parties</h2>
<p>Because we collect nothing, there is nothing to share. We do not serve ads, track users, or sell data.</p>

<h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>This app is suitable for all ages. As no personal information is collected, no information about children is obtained either.</p>

<h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>If this policy changes, we will update this page and revise the date above.</p>

